**GPL Agents** have the whole known universe to police. Their
all-business manner has started rumors that they're robots, or at
least genetically engineered clones. The GPL says otherwise. *Attack
(Stun Baton) +2 [Perks: Paralyzing; Flaws: Ineffective, Low
Penetration], Combat Expert +1, Evasive +1, Perceptive +1; Emotionless
-1, Servitude (GPL) -2.*

